Appropriate': I’ve taken creatine for 10 years. Does it help healthy aging?","link":"https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/age-appropriate-taken-creatine-10-years-help-healthy-aging","thumbnail":"https://media.post.rvohealth.io/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/getty_2297723321_thumb_732x549.jpg","summary":"Does creatine help with healthy aging and longevity? Medical News Today’s Tim Snaith shares his experience of 10 years with creatine, alongside a look at the science and research on its muscle, menopause, brain health, and longevity benefits."},{"title":"Certain saturated fats may turn a ketogenic diet inflammatory, mice study suggests","link":"https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/certain-saturated-fats-may-turn-ketogenic-diet-inflammatory-mice-study","thumbnail":"https://media.post.rvohealth.io/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/getty_2249227389_thumb_732x549.jpg","summary":"Researchers have found that consuming fats featuring long-chain saturated fatty acids — such as red meat and egg yolks — as part of a keto diet may promote an inflammatory response in the body."}],"popularIn":{"title":null,"items":[{"title":"What to do after a baby falls"}]},"countryCode":"KR","hidePlacements":[],"userPreloadDrivers":{"headerNewsletter":{"_driverPath":"/articles/322872","_contentIndex":"page","driverId":"ff4ad816-143d-4c2a-968c-ea480f595bfe","siteId":"40fa3d40-7108-11ea-a8fe-ab86e8b4e4d7","site":"mnt","status":"on","deleted":false,"overridePredictiveRPM":false,"created":"2025-03-06T16:23:33.000Z","updated":"2026-07-10T17:19:12.000Z","createdBy":"liallison@redventures.com","updatedBy":"admin","isTest":true,"overridePredictiveRPMType":"none","sdapiTestName":"","rewardType":"","modelType":"","customModel":false,"holdout":"","driverSet":false,"imageMobile":"https://post.healthline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2ppuDefaultDesktop.jpg","color":"#3d5191","driverTypeId":"1ed6a315-4241-4254-92ae-17d0570ee038","confirmationImageDesktop":"https://post.healthline.com/wp-conte